    '' ---------------------------------------------------------- interfaces (semantic)
    '' docs/tiko-interfaces/TIKO_INTERFACE_OOP_DESIGN.md §13.2. The semantic range 0600-0899
    '' is full, so interfaces open TKO1000-TKO1049 (NUMBERING above). types/itable.tiko.
    DIAG( TKO1000, SEV_ERROR,   "'%0' does not implement '%1.%2'; add 'implements %1.%2' to one of its methods" )
    '' %2: "the parameters", "the return types", "the const-ness", "the passing modes" ...
